<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>Amici Soluciones - Presentación Ejecutiva</title>
<style>
    * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        font-family: 'Segoe UI', Roboto, -apple-system, sans-serif;
    }
    body {
        background-color: #0b0f19;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        padding: 30px 20px;
        gap: 40px;
    }
    
    /* Estructura Slide 16:9 */
    .slide {
        width: 1280px;
        height: 720px;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a 0%, #1e293b 100%);
        color: #f8fafc;
        padding: 40px 48px;
        border-radius: 16px;
        box-shadow: 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        justify-content: space-between;
        position: relative;
        overflow: hidden;
        border: 1px solid #334155;
    }

    /* Decoraciones de Fondo */
    .slide::before {
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        top: -120px;
        right: -120px;
        width: 450px;
        height: 450px;
        background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(56,189,248,0.12) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 70%);
        border-radius: 50%;
        z-index: 0;
        pointer-events: none;
    }

    /* Encabezados */
    header {
        z-index: 1;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: flex-start;
        border-bottom: 2px solid #334155;
        padding-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .slide-num {
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #38bdf8;
        letter-spacing: 2px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        margin-bottom: 4px;
    }
    .title-group h1 {
        font-size: 26px;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #fff;
    }
    .title-group h1 span {
        color: #38bdf8;
    }
    .title-group p {
        font-size: 14px;
        color: #94a3b8;
        margin-top: 2px;
    }
    .badge {
        background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.1);
        border: 1px solid #38bdf8;
        color: #38bdf8;
        padding: 6px 14px;
        border-radius: 20px;
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: 600;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 1px;
    }

    /* Layout Grids */
    .grid-3 {
        z-index: 1;
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1.1fr;
        gap: 20px;
        margin: 16px 0;
    }
    .grid-2-2 {
        z-index: 1;
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        gap: 20px;
        margin: 16px 0;
    }
    .grid-3-col {
        z-index: 1;
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
        gap: 20px;
        margin: 16px 0;
    }

    /* Tarjetas y Contenedores */
    .card {
        background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.7);
        border: 1px solid #334155;
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 20px;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        justify-content: space-between;
        backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    }
    .card-header {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 10px;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .card-title {
        font-size: 15px;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #f1f5f9;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    }
    
    /* Métricas */
    .metric-box {
        background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6);
        border-left: 4px solid #10b981;
        padding: 10px 14px;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
        border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
    }
    .metric-value {
        font-size: 22px;
        font-weight: 800;
        color: #10b981;
    }
    .metric-label {
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #94a3b8;
    }

    /* Tags GAP y Riesgo */
    .tag {
        font-size: 10px;
        font-weight: 800;
        padding: 3px 8px;
        border-radius: 4px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        display: inline-block;
    }
    .tag-critica { background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.2); color: #ef4444; border: 1px solid #ef4444; }
    .tag-alta { background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.2); color: #f59e0b; border: 1px solid #f59e0b; }
    .tag-media { background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.2); color: #3b82f6; border: 1px solid #3b82f6; }

    /* Imagen */
    .img-box {
        position: relative;
        border-radius: 12px;
        overflow: hidden;
        border: 1px solid #334155;
        height: 100%;
    }
    .img-box img {
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        object-fit: cover;
    }
    .img-overlay {
        position: absolute;
        bottom: 0;
        left: 0;
        right: 0;
        background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.95), transparent);
        padding: 16px;
    }

    /* Listas */
    .item-list {
        list-style: none;
    }
    .item-list li {
        margin-bottom: 12px;
        font-size: 13px;
        color: #cbd5e1;
        line-height: 1.4;
    }

    /* Banner Inferior / Conclusión */
    .footer-banner {
        z-index: 1;
        background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(56,189,248,0.12) 0%, rgba(16,185,129,0.12) 100%);
        border: 1px solid #38bdf8;
        border-radius: 10px;
        padding: 14px 20px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 16px;
    }
    .footer-icon {
        background: #38bdf8;
        color: #0f172a;
        width: 36px;
        height: 36px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        font-weight: bold;
        font-size: 18px;
        flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .footer-text h4 {
        font-size: 13px;
        color: #38bdf8;
        text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .footer-text p {
        font-size: 12.5px;
        color: #f1f5f9;
    }

    /* Fases Hoja de Ruta */
    .phase-card {
        background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.8);
        border: 1px solid #334155;
        border-top: 4px solid #38bdf8;
        border-radius: 10px;
        padding: 16px;
    }
    .phase-header {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .phase-title {
        font-size: 14px;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #38bdf8;
    }
    .phase-time {
        font-size: 11px;
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
        padding: 2px 8px;
        border-radius: 10px;
        color: #94a3b8;
    }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- SLIDE 1: DIAGNÓSTICO FINANCIERO -->
<div class="slide">
    <header>
        <div class="title-group">
            <div class="slide-num">Diapositiva 01 / 04</div>
            <h1>DIAGNÓSTICO FINANCIERO Y <span>CAPACIDAD OPERATIVA</span></h1>
            <p>Evaluación de la salud contable actual de POTENZAGF CONSTRUCCIONES S.A.S. (Córdoba)</p>
        </div>
